n urgent priority.\" \"After laboring for years to create a scientific consensus, Sandford Fleming gathered scientific and political representatives from the world's twenty-five independent nations in Washington, D.C., for the Prime Meridian Conference. There, after considerable rancor, delegates agreed to the Greenwich Prime Meridian, the International Date Line, and a single system by which the entire world would measure its longitudes and tell the same time.\" \"In Time Lord, Clark Blaise introduces us to an almost-forgotten figure, who saw the world as a whole and overcame traditional and national objections to the rational accounting of time.\"--Jacket.","subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Time","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-time-lord-the-remarkable-canadian-who-missed-his-train-and-changed-the-world-clark-blaise"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Railroad engineers","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-time-lord-the-remarkable-canadian-who-missed-his-train-and-changed-the-world-clark-blaise"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Systems and standards","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-time-lord-the-remarkable-canadian-who-missed-his-train-and-changed-the-world-clark-blaise"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-time-lord-the-remarkable-canadian-who-missed-his-train-and-changed-the-world-clark-blaise"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"History","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-time-lord-the-remarkable-canadian-who-missed-his-train-and-changed-the-world-clark-blaise"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Long Now Manual for Civilization","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-time-lord-the-remarkable-canadian-who-missed-his-train-and-changed-the-world-clark-blaise"},{"source":"open_libr